{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07593","headline":"仰荅韦司业垂访五首 一 · 萧颖士","name":"仰荅韦司业垂访五首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"呦呦食苹鹿，常饮清泠川。\n但悦丰草美，宁知牢馔鲜。\n主人有幽意，将以充林泉。\n罗网幸免伤，蒙君复羁牵。\n高堂列衆宾，广座鸣清弦。\n俯仰转惊惕，裴回独忧煎。\n缅怀云岩路，欲往无由缘。\n物各有所好，违之伤自然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"萧颖士","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07593.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07593","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}